  "contract": "Provisional local policy approved for this change: XP = floor(next-level XP * 0.02 * 0.4 * profession * difficulty), then Rate.XP.Global (default 1), then dynamic XP. Mining 2.11, herbalism 1.44, skinning 0.55; gray 0, green 0.95, yellow 1, orange 1.05 from PR #4128. Test completed-action skill APIs on real players, not node harvesting or loot. The effective player_xp_for_level row for level 20 is 20800; exact awards truncate only after the profession factors. Requires default profession/global rates and dynamic XP player choice enabled. Capped skill still rewards non-gray actions; missing skill, gray, XP lock and max player level award none. Craft 2330 consumes one each of 2447, 765, 3371 and creates item 118 (Spell.dbc); SkillLineAbility 8053 gives alchemy yellow 55, gray 95. Normal cast verifies crafting rewards and missing-reagent rejection.",
